    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Davis Auctioneers bring to the market, a derelict cottage type residence on approximately 10 Acres, conveniently located to Mohill, Drumlish and Gortletteragh. The property is just a 20 minute drive to Carrick on Shannon and the N4, while Longford Town is just a 20 minute drive away. \r\n\r\nIn need of complete refurbishment and repair throughout, the property is situated along the main Drumlish to Cloone road at the townland of Cloncowley, just a five-minute drive from the village of Drumlish. \r\n\r\nVacant Property Refurbishment Grants are available for this type of property subject to the terms and conditions. When completed, this property would make an ideal family home or holiday retreat away from the demands of city life.\r\n\r\nContained in and part of Folio Number: LD8032\r\n\r\nEircode: N39 TR26\r\n\r\nGPS Coordinates: 53.8609645755247, -7.763047140023792"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Residence with outhouses\r\n\r\nIdeal holiday home destination \r\n\r\nCavan 35 minutes\r\n\r\nLongford 20 minutes\r\n\r\nVacant Property Refurbishment Grant available\r\n\r\nSEAI Energy Grants available also\r\n\r\nHuge potential for development \r\n\r\nBus service to Secondary Schools (Moyne CS) \r\n\r\nCommute to Dublin- 1 hour & 40 mins\r\n\r\nC. 3 miles from the villages of Drumlish and Ballinamuck \r\n\r\nNOTE:\r\nReceipt of these particulars implies an obligation to conduct all negotiations through Padraic Davis Auctioneers. The contents do not constitute an offer or form the basis of any contract. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition etc, are given in good faith and are believed to be correct. Any intending purchasers should not rely on them and are strongly advised to view the property for themselves. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided are for guidance purposes only. The boundary markings for this property, outlined in Red, are strictly for guidance purposes only. These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer; they do not form any part of a resulting contract."
      }
